    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Fantastic 3 bedroom detached bungalow providing generous accommodation with bright and spacious living areas, which extends to c. 119 sq.m. (1,281 sq.ft.). ''Leskinfere'' offers plenty of flexible living space throughout, which is complemented to the rear with a large private west facing garden. Pleasantly situated within approx. 10 minutes drive from both Drogheda Town, and the quaint and picturesque village of Clogherhead, the property is also only a short drive away from Seapoint Golf Club at Termonfeckin and the famous County Louth Golf Club at Baltray. The M1 motorway is c.20 minutes drive from the property giving access to the Dublin-Belfast corridor. Viewing Is Highly Recommended\n\nAMV - 425,000 For Sale by Private Treaty\n\nFeatures\n3 Bedroom Detached Property\nExtends to C. 119 sq.m. (1,281 sq.ft.)\nO-F-C-H High Efficiency Boiler\nGas Fire Bottle LPG\nUpgraded Cavity Wall Insulation\nPVC Double Glazing Throughout\nMains Water Softener\nWater - Mains Water Supply \nWaste Septic Tank Registered\nPull Down Staircase To Attic Storage\nLarge Block Built Detached Garage\nMature Surrounding Gardens\nPrivate Surrounding Aspects\nRear Patio Area\nWest Facing Rear Orientation\nAmple Parking\nFront Security Gates\nFully Alarmed\n\nAccommodation Includes\nEntrance Hallway\nLiving Room(4.00m x5.83m)\nKitchen / Dining(4.81m x 4.00m)\n (3.16m x 1.85m)\nUtility Room(1.80m x 1.18m)\nBedroom 1(4.23m x 3.80m)\nEn Suite (2.55m x 1.33m)\nBedroom 2(3.71m x 3.11m)\nBedroom 3(3.01m x 3.80m)\nMain Bathroom(3.12m x 2.51m)\n\nBuilding Energy Rating\nBER: C\nBER No. 105904007\n\nViewing Details\nStrictly by appointment with the sole selling agent.\n\n\n"
      },
